==Battleground==
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Metal Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~60 seconds<sup>600f~1,800f</sup>.
*5 [[Metal Snache]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The One Horns can be easily dealt with by [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]], and you can use a critical hitter like [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]] or [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat]] on the Metal Hippoes and Metal Snaches. If you have [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]], this level becomes a joke.

